# Speed Cards starter deck: Mandarin Chinese. seed-version: 1

@deck 旅行 Travel survival
@type Chinese Vocab
@tags travel
@languages zh-CN en-US

id: seed-zh-travel-001
Simplified: 厕所
Traditional: 廁所
Pinyin: cèsuǒ
English: toilet, restroom
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 请问，厕所在哪儿？
Example (Traditional): 請問，廁所在哪兒？
Example pinyin: Qǐngwèn, cèsuǒ zài nǎr?
Example (EN): Excuse me, where is the restroom?
Notes: 洗手间 (xǐshǒujiān) is more polite.
links: synonym [[seed-zh-travel-002]]

id: seed-zh-travel-002
Simplified: 洗手间
Traditional: 洗手間
Pinyin: xǐshǒujiān
English: restroom, washroom
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 洗手间在二楼。
Example (Traditional): 洗手間在二樓。
Example pinyin: Xǐshǒujiān zài èr lóu.
Example (EN): The restroom is on the second floor.

id: seed-zh-travel-003
Simplified: 你好
Traditional: 你好
Pinyin: nǐ hǎo
English: hello
Example (Simplified): 你好，我叫安娜。
Example (Traditional): 你好，我叫安娜。
Example pinyin: Nǐ hǎo, wǒ jiào Ānnà.
Example (EN): Hello, my name is Anna.
Notes: Pronounced ní hǎo in speech (third-tone sandhi). 您好 (nín hǎo) is more polite.

id: seed-zh-travel-004
Simplified: 谢谢
Traditional: 謝謝
Pinyin: xièxie
English: thank you
Example (Simplified): 谢谢你的帮助。
Example (Traditional): 謝謝你的幫助。
Example pinyin: Xièxie nǐ de bāngzhù.
Example (EN): Thank you for your help.

id: seed-zh-travel-005
Simplified: 不客气
Traditional: 不客氣
Pinyin: bù kèqi
English: you're welcome
Example (Simplified): 不客气，这是我应该做的。
Example (Traditional): 不客氣，這是我應該做的。
Example pinyin: Bù kèqi, zhè shì wǒ yīnggāi zuò de.
Example (EN): You're welcome, it was the least I could do.
Notes: 不 is pronounced bú before a fourth tone.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-004]]

id: seed-zh-travel-006
Simplified: 对不起
Traditional: 對不起
Pinyin: duìbuqǐ
English: sorry, excuse me
Example (Simplified): 对不起，我来晚了。
Example (Traditional): 對不起，我來晚了。
Example pinyin: Duìbuqǐ, wǒ lái wǎn le.
Example (EN): Sorry, I'm late.

id: seed-zh-travel-007
Simplified: 没关系
Traditional: 沒關係
Pinyin: méi guānxi
English: it doesn't matter, no problem
Example (Simplified): 没关系，别担心。
Example (Traditional): 沒關係，別擔心。
Example pinyin: Méi guānxi, bié dānxīn.
Example (EN): It's fine, don't worry.
Notes: The usual reply to 对不起.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-006]]

id: seed-zh-travel-008
Simplified: 请问
Traditional: 請問
Pinyin: qǐngwèn
English: excuse me, may I ask
Example (Simplified): 请问，地铁站怎么走？
Example (Traditional): 請問，地鐵站怎麼走？
Example pinyin: Qǐngwèn, dìtiězhàn zěnme zǒu?
Example (EN): Excuse me, how do I get to the subway station?
Notes: Polite way to start a question to a stranger.

id: seed-zh-travel-009
Simplified: 多少钱
Traditional: 多少錢
Pinyin: duōshao qián
English: how much (does it cost)?
Example (Simplified): 这个多少钱？
Example (Traditional): 這個多少錢？
Example pinyin: Zhège duōshao qián?
Example (EN): How much is this?

id: seed-zh-travel-010
Simplified: 太贵了
Traditional: 太貴了
Pinyin: tài guì le
English: too expensive
Example (Simplified): 太贵了，便宜一点吧。
Example (Traditional): 太貴了，便宜一點吧。
Example pinyin: Tài guì le, piányi yīdiǎn ba.
Example (EN): That's too expensive, can you make it a bit cheaper?
Notes: Useful for bargaining at markets.
links: antonym [[seed-zh-travel-011]]

id: seed-zh-travel-011
Simplified: 便宜
Traditional: 便宜
Pinyin: piányi
English: cheap, inexpensive
Example (Simplified): 这家饭馆很便宜。
Example (Traditional): 這家飯館很便宜。
Example pinyin: Zhè jiā fànguǎn hěn piányi.
Example (EN): This restaurant is cheap.

id: seed-zh-travel-012
Simplified: 块
Traditional: 塊
Pinyin: kuài
English: yuan (colloquial unit of money)
Example (Simplified): 一瓶水三块钱。
Example (Traditional): 一瓶水三塊錢。
Example pinyin: Yī píng shuǐ sān kuài qián.
Example (EN): A bottle of water costs three yuan.
Notes: 元 (yuán) is the written/formal form; 块 is also a measure word for pieces.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-009]]

id: seed-zh-travel-013
Simplified: 我听不懂
Traditional: 我聽不懂
Pinyin: wǒ tīng bu dǒng
English: I don't understand (what I hear)
Example (Simplified): 对不起，我听不懂中文。
Example (Traditional): 對不起，我聽不懂中文。
Example pinyin: Duìbuqǐ, wǒ tīng bu dǒng Zhōngwén.
Example (EN): Sorry, I don't understand spoken Chinese.
Notes: 看不懂 (kàn bu dǒng) = can't understand something written.

id: seed-zh-travel-014
Simplified: 请说慢一点
Traditional: 請說慢一點
Pinyin: qǐng shuō màn yīdiǎn
English: please speak more slowly
Example (Simplified): 请说慢一点，我是外国人。
Example (Traditional): 請說慢一點，我是外國人。
Example pinyin: Qǐng shuō màn yīdiǎn, wǒ shì wàiguórén.
Example (EN): Please speak more slowly, I'm a foreigner.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-013]]

id: seed-zh-travel-015
Simplified: 救命
Traditional: 救命
Pinyin: jiùmìng
English: help! (emergency)
Example (Simplified): 救命！有人掉进水里了！
Example (Traditional): 救命！有人掉進水裡了！
Example pinyin: Jiùmìng! Yǒu rén diào jìn shuǐ li le!
Example (EN): Help! Someone has fallen into the water!
Notes: Only for real emergencies.

id: seed-zh-travel-016
Simplified: 哪儿
Traditional: 哪兒
Pinyin: nǎr
English: where
Example (Simplified): 你住在哪儿？
Example (Traditional): 你住在哪兒？
Example pinyin: Nǐ zhù zài nǎr?
Example (EN): Where are you staying?
Notes: Northern usage; 哪里 (nǎlǐ) is common in the south and Taiwan.

id: seed-zh-travel-017
Simplified: 左
Traditional: 左
Pinyin: zuǒ
English: left
Example (Simplified): 前面路口往左拐。
Example (Traditional): 前面路口往左拐。
Example pinyin: Qiánmiàn lùkǒu wǎng zuǒ guǎi.
Example (EN): Turn left at the intersection ahead.

id: seed-zh-travel-018
Simplified: 右
Traditional: 右
Pinyin: yòu
English: right
Example (Simplified): 银行在右边。
Example (Traditional): 銀行在右邊。
Example pinyin: Yínháng zài yòubian.
Example (EN): The bank is on the right.
links: antonym [[seed-zh-travel-017]]

id: seed-zh-travel-019
Simplified: 一直走
Traditional: 一直走
Pinyin: yīzhí zǒu
English: go straight ahead
Example (Simplified): 一直走，然后往右拐。
Example (Traditional): 一直走，然後往右拐。
Example pinyin: Yīzhí zǒu, ránhòu wǎng yòu guǎi.
Example (EN): Go straight, then turn right.

id: seed-zh-travel-020
Simplified: 地铁
Traditional: 地鐵
Pinyin: dìtiě
English: subway, metro
Example (Simplified): 我们坐地铁去吧。
Example (Traditional): 我們坐地鐵去吧。
Example pinyin: Wǒmen zuò dìtiě qù ba.
Example (EN): Let's take the subway.
Notes: In Taiwan the metro is called 捷运 (jiéyùn).

id: seed-zh-travel-021
Simplified: 出租车
Traditional: 出租車
Pinyin: chūzūchē
English: taxi
Measure word: 辆 (liàng)
Example (Simplified): 请帮我叫一辆出租车。
Example (Traditional): 請幫我叫一輛出租車。
Example pinyin: Qǐng bāng wǒ jiào yī liàng chūzūchē.
Example (EN): Please call a taxi for me.
Notes: 打车 (dǎchē) = to take a taxi. Taiwan: 计程车 (jìchéngchē).

id: seed-zh-travel-022
Simplified: 火车站
Traditional: 火車站
Pinyin: huǒchēzhàn
English: train station
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 火车站离这儿远吗？
Example (Traditional): 火車站離這兒遠嗎？
Example pinyin: Huǒchēzhàn lí zhèr yuǎn ma?
Example (EN): Is the train station far from here?

id: seed-zh-travel-023
Simplified: 机场
Traditional: 機場
Pinyin: jīchǎng
English: airport
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我要去机场。
Example (Traditional): 我要去機場。
Example pinyin: Wǒ yào qù jīchǎng.
Example (EN): I need to go to the airport.

id: seed-zh-travel-024
Simplified: 票
Traditional: 票
Pinyin: piào
English: ticket
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 我想买两张票。
Example (Traditional): 我想買兩張票。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xiǎng mǎi liǎng zhāng piào.
Example (EN): I'd like to buy two tickets.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-022]]

id: seed-zh-travel-025
Simplified: 公交车
Traditional: 公交車
Pinyin: gōngjiāochē
English: bus
Measure word: 辆 (liàng)
Example (Simplified): 这辆公交车去火车站吗？
Example (Traditional): 這輛公交車去火車站嗎？
Example pinyin: Zhè liàng gōngjiāochē qù huǒchēzhàn ma?
Example (EN): Does this bus go to the train station?
Notes: Taiwan: 公车 (gōngchē).
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-travel-021]]

id: seed-zh-travel-026
Simplified: 菜单
Traditional: 菜單
Pinyin: càidān
English: menu
Measure word: 份 (fèn)
Example (Simplified): 服务员，请给我菜单。
Example (Traditional): 服務員，請給我菜單。
Example pinyin: Fúwùyuán, qǐng gěi wǒ càidān.
Example (EN): Waiter, could I have the menu, please?

id: seed-zh-travel-027
Simplified: 买单
Traditional: 買單
Pinyin: mǎidān
English: the bill, please; to pay the bill
Example (Simplified): 服务员，买单！
Example (Traditional): 服務員，買單！
Example pinyin: Fúwùyuán, mǎidān!
Example (EN): Waiter, the bill please!
Notes: 结账 (jiézhàng) is also common.
links: same root [[seed-zh-travel-026]]

id: seed-zh-travel-028
Simplified: 不要辣
Traditional: 不要辣
Pinyin: bùyào là
English: not spicy, please (no chili)
Example (Simplified): 这个菜不要辣，谢谢。
Example (Traditional): 這個菜不要辣，謝謝。
Example pinyin: Zhège cài bùyào là, xièxie.
Example (EN): No chili in this dish, please.
Notes: 微辣 (wēilà) = mildly spicy.

id: seed-zh-travel-029
Simplified: 水
Traditional: 水
Pinyin: shuǐ
English: water
Example (Simplified): 请给我一杯水。
Example (Traditional): 請給我一杯水。
Example pinyin: Qǐng gěi wǒ yī bēi shuǐ.
Example (EN): Please give me a glass of water.
Notes: 热水 (rèshuǐ) = hot water; 冰水 (bīngshuǐ) = iced water.

id: seed-zh-travel-030
Simplified: 好吃
Traditional: 好吃
Pinyin: hǎochī
English: delicious, tasty
Example (Simplified): 这个饺子很好吃。
Example (Traditional): 這個餃子很好吃。
Example pinyin: Zhège jiǎozi hěn hǎochī.
Example (EN): These dumplings are delicious.

id: seed-zh-travel-031
Simplified: 我要这个
Traditional: 我要這個
Pinyin: wǒ yào zhège
English: I'll have this one
Example (Simplified): 我要这个，再要一碗米饭。
Example (Traditional): 我要這個，再要一碗米飯。
Example pinyin: Wǒ yào zhège, zài yào yī wǎn mǐfàn.
Example (EN): I'll have this, and a bowl of rice as well.
Notes: Handy when pointing at a menu picture.

id: seed-zh-travel-032
Simplified: 酒店
Traditional: 酒店
Pinyin: jiǔdiàn
English: hotel
Measure word: 家 (jiā)
Example (Simplified): 这家酒店很干净。
Example (Traditional): 這家酒店很乾淨。
Example pinyin: Zhè jiā jiǔdiàn hěn gānjìng.
Example (EN): This hotel is very clean.
Notes: Also 宾馆 (bīnguǎn); in Taiwan often 饭店 (fàndiàn).

id: seed-zh-travel-033
Simplified: 房间
Traditional: 房間
Pinyin: fángjiān
English: room
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我订了一个房间。
Example (Traditional): 我訂了一個房間。
Example pinyin: Wǒ dìngle yī gè fángjiān.
Example (EN): I booked a room.

id: seed-zh-travel-034
Simplified: 护照
Traditional: 護照
Pinyin: hùzhào
English: passport
Measure word: 本 (běn)
Example (Simplified): 请出示您的护照。
Example (Traditional): 請出示您的護照。
Example pinyin: Qǐng chūshì nín de hùzhào.
Example (EN): Please show your passport.

id: seed-zh-travel-035
Simplified: 预订
Traditional: 預訂
Pinyin: yùdìng
English: to book, to reserve; booking
Example (Simplified): 我在网上预订了房间。
Example (Traditional): 我在網上預訂了房間。
Example pinyin: Wǒ zài wǎngshang yùdìngle fángjiān.
Example (EN): I booked the room online.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-033]]

id: seed-zh-travel-036
Simplified: 钥匙
Traditional: 鑰匙
Pinyin: yàoshi
English: key
Measure word: 把 (bǎ)
Example (Simplified): 我的房间钥匙丢了。
Example (Traditional): 我的房間鑰匙丟了。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de fángjiān yàoshi diū le.
Example (EN): I've lost my room key.
Notes: Hotels often use a key card: 房卡 (fángkǎ).
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-033]]

id: seed-zh-travel-037
Simplified: 医院
Traditional: 醫院
Pinyin: yīyuàn
English: hospital
Measure word: 家 (jiā)
Example (Simplified): 最近的医院在哪儿？
Example (Traditional): 最近的醫院在哪兒？
Example pinyin: Zuìjìn de yīyuàn zài nǎr?
Example (EN): Where is the nearest hospital?
Notes: Mainland emergency ambulance number: 120.

id: seed-zh-travel-038
Simplified: 药
Traditional: 藥
Pinyin: yào
English: medicine, drug
Example (Simplified): 这个药一天吃三次。
Example (Traditional): 這個藥一天吃三次。
Example pinyin: Zhège yào yī tiān chī sān cì.
Example (EN): Take this medicine three times a day.
Notes: 药店 (yàodiàn) = pharmacy. Chinese "eats" medicine (吃药).

id: seed-zh-travel-039
Simplified: 警察
Traditional: 警察
Pinyin: jǐngchá
English: police, police officer
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 快叫警察！
Example (Traditional): 快叫警察！
Example pinyin: Kuài jiào jǐngchá!
Example (EN): Call the police, quick!
Notes: Mainland police number: 110.

id: seed-zh-travel-040
Simplified: 生病
Traditional: 生病
Pinyin: shēngbìng
English: to get sick, to be ill
Example (Simplified): 我生病了，要去医院。
Example (Traditional): 我生病了，要去醫院。
Example pinyin: Wǒ shēngbìng le, yào qù yīyuàn.
Example (EN): I'm sick and need to go to the hospital.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-037]]

id: seed-zh-travel-041
Simplified: 疼
Traditional: 疼
Pinyin: téng
English: to hurt, painful
Example (Simplified): 我肚子很疼。
Example (Traditional): 我肚子很疼。
Example pinyin: Wǒ dùzi hěn téng.
Example (EN): My stomach really hurts.
Notes: 痛 (tòng) is a common alternative.

id: seed-zh-travel-042
Simplified: 帮忙
Traditional: 幫忙
Pinyin: bāngmáng
English: to help, to do a favour
Example (Simplified): 谢谢你帮忙！
Example (Traditional): 謝謝你幫忙！
Example pinyin: Xièxie nǐ bāngmáng!
Example (EN): Thanks for helping!
Notes: Separable verb: 帮个忙 (bāng gè máng) = do me a favour.

id: seed-zh-travel-043
Simplified: 现在
Traditional: 現在
Pinyin: xiànzài
English: now
Example (Simplified): 现在几点？
Example (Traditional): 現在幾點？
Example pinyin: Xiànzài jǐ diǎn?
Example (EN): What time is it now?

id: seed-zh-travel-044
Simplified: 点
Traditional: 點
Pinyin: diǎn
English: o'clock
Example (Simplified): 火车早上八点开。
Example (Traditional): 火車早上八點開。
Example pinyin: Huǒchē zǎoshang bā diǎn kāi.
Example (EN): The train leaves at eight in the morning.
Notes: 8:30 = 八点半 (bā diǎn bàn).
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-043]]

id: seed-zh-travel-045
Simplified: 今天
Traditional: 今天
Pinyin: jīntiān
English: today
Example (Simplified): 今天我们去长城。
Example (Traditional): 今天我們去長城。
Example pinyin: Jīntiān wǒmen qù Chángchéng.
Example (EN): Today we're going to the Great Wall.

id: seed-zh-travel-046
Simplified: 明天
Traditional: 明天
Pinyin: míngtiān
English: tomorrow
Example (Simplified): 明天见！
Example (Traditional): 明天見！
Example pinyin: Míngtiān jiàn!
Example (EN): See you tomorrow!
links: same root [[seed-zh-travel-045]]

id: seed-zh-travel-047
Simplified: 两
Traditional: 兩
Pinyin: liǎng
English: two (before measure words)
Example (Simplified): 我要两瓶啤酒。
Example (Traditional): 我要兩瓶啤酒。
Example pinyin: Wǒ yào liǎng píng píjiǔ.
Example (EN): I'd like two bottles of beer.
Notes: Use 两 before a measure word; use 二 (èr) when counting or in numbers like 十二.

id: seed-zh-travel-048
Simplified: 百
Traditional: 百
Pinyin: bǎi
English: hundred
Example (Simplified): 这件衣服两百块。
Example (Traditional): 這件衣服兩百塊。
Example pinyin: Zhè jiàn yīfu liǎng bǎi kuài.
Example (EN): This item of clothing is 200 yuan.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-travel-012]]

id: seed-zh-travel-049
Simplified: 刷卡
Traditional: 刷卡
Pinyin: shuākǎ
English: to pay by card, swipe a card
Example (Simplified): 可以刷卡吗？
Example (Traditional): 可以刷卡嗎？
Example pinyin: Kěyǐ shuākǎ ma?
Example (EN): Can I pay by card?
Notes: In mainland China mobile payment (扫码 sǎomǎ, scanning a QR code) is far more common.

id: seed-zh-travel-050
Simplified: 再见
Traditional: 再見
Pinyin: zàijiàn
English: goodbye
Example (Simplified): 再见，路上小心！
Example (Traditional): 再見，路上小心！
Example pinyin: Zàijiàn, lùshang xiǎoxīn!
Example (EN): Goodbye, take care on the way!
links: antonym [[seed-zh-travel-003]]

id: seed-zh-travel-051
Simplified: 迷路
Traditional: 迷路
Pinyin: mílù
English: to get lost
Example (Simplified): 我迷路了，你能帮我吗？
Example (Traditional): 我迷路了，你能幫我嗎？
Example pinyin: Wǒ mílù le, nǐ néng bāng wǒ ma?
Example (EN): I'm lost, can you help me?


@deck 射箭 Archery
@type Chinese Vocab
@tags archery
@languages zh-CN en-US

id: seed-zh-archery-001
Simplified: 射箭
Traditional: 射箭
Pinyin: shèjiàn
English: archery; to shoot arrows
Example (Simplified): 我每个周末都去射箭。
Example (Traditional): 我每個週末都去射箭。
Example pinyin: Wǒ měi gè zhōumò dōu qù shèjiàn.
Example (EN): I go to archery every weekend.

id: seed-zh-archery-002
Simplified: 弓
Traditional: 弓
Pinyin: gōng
English: bow
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 这张弓很轻。
Example (Traditional): 這張弓很輕。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhāng gōng hěn qīng.
Example (EN): This bow is very light.
Notes: 把 (bǎ) is also used as the measure word.

id: seed-zh-archery-003
Simplified: 箭
Traditional: 箭
Pinyin: jiàn
English: arrow
Measure word: 支 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 他射了六支箭。
Example (Traditional): 他射了六支箭。
Example pinyin: Tā shèle liù zhī jiàn.
Example (EN): He shot six arrows.

id: seed-zh-archery-004
Simplified: 弓箭
Traditional: 弓箭
Pinyin: gōngjiàn
English: bow and arrow
Example (Simplified): 古代人用弓箭打猎。
Example (Traditional): 古代人用弓箭打獵。
Example pinyin: Gǔdài rén yòng gōngjiàn dǎliè.
Example (EN): In ancient times people hunted with bows and arrows.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-002]] [[seed-zh-archery-003]]

id: seed-zh-archery-005
Simplified: 箭袋
Traditional: 箭袋
Pinyin: jiàndài
English: quiver
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 把箭放回箭袋里。
Example (Traditional): 把箭放回箭袋裡。
Example pinyin: Bǎ jiàn fàng huí jiàndài li.
Example (EN): Put the arrows back in the quiver.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-003]]

id: seed-zh-archery-006
Simplified: 弓弦
Traditional: 弓弦
Pinyin: gōngxián
English: bowstring
Measure word: 根 (gēn)
Example (Simplified): 弓弦断了，要换一根新的。
Example (Traditional): 弓弦斷了，要換一根新的。
Example pinyin: Gōngxián duàn le, yào huàn yī gēn xīn de.
Example (EN): The bowstring broke, so I need a new one.

id: seed-zh-archery-007
Simplified: 箭靶
Traditional: 箭靶
Pinyin: jiànbǎ
English: archery target
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 箭靶离我们七十米。
Example (Traditional): 箭靶離我們七十米。
Example pinyin: Jiànbǎ lí wǒmen qīshí mǐ.
Example (EN): The target is 70 metres away from us.
Notes: Colloquially 靶子 (bǎzi).

id: seed-zh-archery-008
Simplified: 靶心
Traditional: 靶心
Pinyin: bǎxīn
English: bullseye, centre of the target
Example (Simplified): 他第一箭就射中了靶心。
Example (Traditional): 他第一箭就射中了靶心。
Example pinyin: Tā dì yī jiàn jiù shèzhòngle bǎxīn.
Example (EN): He hit the bullseye with his very first arrow.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-007]]

id: seed-zh-archery-009
Simplified: 瞄准器
Traditional: 瞄準器
Pinyin: miáozhǔnqì
English: bow sight
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我调了一下瞄准器。
Example (Traditional): 我調了一下瞄準器。
Example pinyin: Wǒ tiáole yīxià miáozhǔnqì.
Example (EN): I adjusted the sight a little.

id: seed-zh-archery-010
Simplified: 护臂
Traditional: 護臂
Pinyin: hùbì
English: arm guard
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 射箭时要戴护臂。
Example (Traditional): 射箭時要戴護臂。
Example pinyin: Shèjiàn shí yào dài hùbì.
Example (EN): Wear an arm guard when you shoot.

id: seed-zh-archery-011
Simplified: 护指
Traditional: 護指
Pinyin: hùzhǐ
English: finger tab
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 护指可以保护你的手指。
Example (Traditional): 護指可以保護你的手指。
Example pinyin: Hùzhǐ kěyǐ bǎohù nǐ de shǒuzhǐ.
Example (EN): A finger tab protects your fingers.
Notes: Also called 指护 (zhǐhù). A thumb ring for traditional archery is 扳指 (bānzhǐ).
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-010]]

id: seed-zh-archery-012
Simplified: 箭头
Traditional: 箭頭
Pinyin: jiàntóu
English: arrowhead, arrow point; arrow sign
Example (Simplified): 箭头插在靶子上。
Example (Traditional): 箭頭插在靶子上。
Example pinyin: Jiàntóu chā zài bǎzi shang.
Example (EN): The arrowhead is stuck in the target.

id: seed-zh-archery-013
Simplified: 箭羽
Traditional: 箭羽
Pinyin: jiànyǔ
English: fletching (arrow feathers or vanes)
Example (Simplified): 这支箭的箭羽坏了。
Example (Traditional): 這支箭的箭羽壞了。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī jiàn de jiànyǔ huài le.
Example (EN): The fletching on this arrow is damaged.

id: seed-zh-archery-014
Simplified: 箭杆
Traditional: 箭桿
Pinyin: jiàngǎn
English: arrow shaft
Measure word: 根 (gēn)
Example (Simplified): 碳素箭杆又轻又直。
Example (Traditional): 碳素箭桿又輕又直。
Example pinyin: Tànsù jiàngǎn yòu qīng yòu zhí.
Example (EN): Carbon arrow shafts are light and straight.

id: seed-zh-archery-015
Simplified: 反曲弓
Traditional: 反曲弓
Pinyin: fǎnqūgōng
English: recurve bow
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 奥运会比赛用的是反曲弓。
Example (Traditional): 奧運會比賽用的是反曲弓。
Example pinyin: Àoyùnhuì bǐsài yòng de shì fǎnqūgōng.
Example (EN): The recurve bow is used in Olympic competition.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-002]]

id: seed-zh-archery-016
Simplified: 复合弓
Traditional: 複合弓
Pinyin: fùhégōng
English: compound bow
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 复合弓有滑轮，拉起来比较省力。
Example (Traditional): 複合弓有滑輪，拉起來比較省力。
Example pinyin: Fùhégōng yǒu huálún, lā qǐlai bǐjiào shěnglì.
Example (EN): A compound bow has cams, so it takes less effort to draw.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-002]]

id: seed-zh-archery-017
Simplified: 传统弓
Traditional: 傳統弓
Pinyin: chuántǒnggōng
English: traditional bow
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 我更喜欢传统弓。
Example (Traditional): 我更喜歡傳統弓。
Example pinyin: Wǒ gèng xǐhuan chuántǒnggōng.
Example (EN): I prefer traditional bows.
Notes: Usually shot without a sight.

id: seed-zh-archery-018
Simplified: 拉弓
Traditional: 拉弓
Pinyin: lāgōng
English: to draw the bow
Example (Simplified): 拉弓的时候背要用力。
Example (Traditional): 拉弓的時候背要用力。
Example pinyin: Lāgōng de shíhou bèi yào yònglì.
Example (EN): Use your back muscles when you draw the bow.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-archery-002]]

id: seed-zh-archery-019
Simplified: 瞄准
Traditional: 瞄準
Pinyin: miáozhǔn
English: to aim
Example (Simplified): 瞄准靶心，别着急。
Example (Traditional): 瞄準靶心，別著急。
Example pinyin: Miáozhǔn bǎxīn, bié zháojí.
Example (EN): Aim at the bullseye and don't rush.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-009]]

id: seed-zh-archery-020
Simplified: 撒放
Traditional: 撒放
Pinyin: sāfàng
English: release (technical term)
Example (Simplified): 撒放要干净，手指放松。
Example (Traditional): 撒放要乾淨，手指放鬆。
Example pinyin: Sāfàng yào gānjìng, shǒuzhǐ fàngsōng.
Example (EN): Make a clean release; relax your fingers.
Notes: Coaching term; in everyday speech people say 放箭.
links: synonym [[seed-zh-archery-021]]

id: seed-zh-archery-021
Simplified: 放箭
Traditional: 放箭
Pinyin: fàngjiàn
English: to loose an arrow, to shoot
Example (Simplified): 听到口令再放箭。
Example (Traditional): 聽到口令再放箭。
Example pinyin: Tīngdào kǒulìng zài fàngjiàn.
Example (EN): Don't shoot until you hear the command.

id: seed-zh-archery-022
Simplified: 射
Traditional: 射
Pinyin: shè
English: to shoot
Example (Simplified): 你射得真准！
Example (Traditional): 你射得真準！
Example pinyin: Nǐ shè de zhēn zhǔn!
Example (EN): You shoot really accurately!

id: seed-zh-archery-023
Simplified: 射中
Traditional: 射中
Pinyin: shèzhòng
English: to hit (the target)
Example (Simplified): 这一箭没射中。
Example (Traditional): 這一箭沒射中。
Example pinyin: Zhè yī jiàn méi shèzhòng.
Example (EN): This arrow missed.
Notes: 中 is read zhòng (fourth tone) here, meaning "to hit".
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-022]]

id: seed-zh-archery-024
Simplified: 脱靶
Traditional: 脫靶
Pinyin: tuōbǎ
English: to miss the target
Example (Simplified): 风太大，我脱靶了两次。
Example (Traditional): 風太大，我脫靶了兩次。
Example pinyin: Fēng tài dà, wǒ tuōbǎle liǎng cì.
Example (EN): It was too windy, and I missed the target twice.
links: antonym [[seed-zh-archery-023]]

id: seed-zh-archery-025
Simplified: 拔箭
Traditional: 拔箭
Pinyin: bájiàn
English: to pull arrows (from the target)
Example (Simplified): 大家一起去拔箭吧。
Example (Traditional): 大家一起去拔箭吧。
Example pinyin: Dàjiā yīqǐ qù bájiàn ba.
Example (EN): Let's all go and pull our arrows.

id: seed-zh-archery-026
Simplified: 搭箭
Traditional: 搭箭
Pinyin: dājiàn
English: to nock an arrow
Example (Simplified): 先搭箭，再拉弓。
Example (Traditional): 先搭箭，再拉弓。
Example pinyin: Xiān dājiàn, zài lāgōng.
Example (EN): Nock the arrow first, then draw the bow.

id: seed-zh-archery-027
Simplified: 站姿
Traditional: 站姿
Pinyin: zhànzī
English: stance, standing posture
Example (Simplified): 你的站姿很稳。
Example (Traditional): 你的站姿很穩。
Example pinyin: Nǐ de zhànzī hěn wěn.
Example (EN): Your stance is very stable.

id: seed-zh-archery-028
Simplified: 靠位
Traditional: 靠位
Pinyin: kàowèi
English: anchor (point)
Example (Simplified): 每次靠位都要在同一个地方。
Example (Traditional): 每次靠位都要在同一個地方。
Example pinyin: Měi cì kàowèi dōu yào zài tóng yī gè dìfang.
Example (EN): Your anchor should be in the same place every time.
Notes: Coaching term for where the drawing hand rests on the face.

id: seed-zh-archery-029
Simplified: 射箭场
Traditional: 射箭場
Pinyin: shèjiànchǎng
English: archery range
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 这个射箭场有十个靶位。
Example (Traditional): 這個射箭場有十個靶位。
Example pinyin: Zhège shèjiànchǎng yǒu shí gè bǎwèi.
Example (EN): This archery range has ten target lanes.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-001]]

id: seed-zh-archery-030
Simplified: 射箭馆
Traditional: 射箭館
Pinyin: shèjiànguǎn
English: archery club, indoor range
Measure word: 家 (jiā)
Example (Simplified): 我家附近开了一家射箭馆。
Example (Traditional): 我家附近開了一家射箭館。
Example pinyin: Wǒ jiā fùjìn kāile yī jiā shèjiànguǎn.
Example (EN): An archery club has opened near my home.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-001]]

id: seed-zh-archery-031
Simplified: 环
Traditional: 環
Pinyin: huán
English: ring (scoring zone); point
Example (Simplified): 这一箭是十环！
Example (Traditional): 這一箭是十環！
Example pinyin: Zhè yī jiàn shì shí huán!
Example (EN): That arrow is a ten!
Notes: In archery and shooting, scores are counted in rings: 十环 = a ten.

id: seed-zh-archery-032
Simplified: 分
Traditional: 分
Pinyin: fēn
English: point, score
Example (Simplified): 他比我多三分。
Example (Traditional): 他比我多三分。
Example pinyin: Tā bǐ wǒ duō sān fēn.
Example (EN): He has three points more than me.

id: seed-zh-archery-033
Simplified: 比赛
Traditional: 比賽
Pinyin: bǐsài
English: competition, match
Measure word: 场 (chǎng)
Example (Simplified): 下个月我要参加射箭比赛。
Example (Traditional): 下個月我要參加射箭比賽。
Example pinyin: Xià gè yuè wǒ yào cānjiā shèjiàn bǐsài.
Example (EN): Next month I'm taking part in an archery competition.

id: seed-zh-archery-034
Simplified: 距离
Traditional: 距離
Pinyin: jùlí
English: distance
Example (Simplified): 室内比赛的距离是十八米。
Example (Traditional): 室內比賽的距離是十八米。
Example pinyin: Shìnèi bǐsài de jùlí shì shíbā mǐ.
Example (EN): The distance for indoor competitions is 18 metres.

id: seed-zh-archery-035
Simplified: 米
Traditional: 米
Pinyin: mǐ
English: metre
Example (Simplified): 我现在能射三十米了。
Example (Traditional): 我現在能射三十米了。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xiànzài néng shè sānshí mǐ le.
Example (EN): I can shoot at 30 metres now.
Notes: Also means "rice (uncooked)".
links: collocation [[seed-zh-archery-034]]

id: seed-zh-archery-036
Simplified: 射手
Traditional: 射手
Pinyin: shèshǒu
English: archer, shooter
Measure word: 名 (míng)
Example (Simplified): 她是一名优秀的射手。
Example (Traditional): 她是一名優秀的射手。
Example pinyin: Tā shì yī míng yōuxiù de shèshǒu.
Example (EN): She is an excellent archer.
Notes: 弓箭手 (gōngjiànshǒu) is used for archers in history and games.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-022]]

id: seed-zh-archery-037
Simplified: 教练
Traditional: 教練
Pinyin: jiàoliàn
English: coach, instructor
Measure word: 位 (wèi)
Example (Simplified): 教练帮我纠正了动作。
Example (Traditional): 教練幫我糾正了動作。
Example pinyin: Jiàoliàn bāng wǒ jiūzhèngle dòngzuò.
Example (EN): The coach helped me correct my technique.

id: seed-zh-archery-038
Simplified: 安全
Traditional: 安全
Pinyin: ānquán
English: safety; safe
Example (Simplified): 射箭时安全第一。
Example (Traditional): 射箭時安全第一。
Example pinyin: Shèjiàn shí ānquán dì yī.
Example (EN): In archery, safety comes first.

id: seed-zh-archery-039
Simplified: 起射线
Traditional: 起射線
Pinyin: qǐshèxiàn
English: shooting line
Measure word: 条 (tiáo)
Example (Simplified): 请站在起射线后面。
Example (Traditional): 請站在起射線後面。
Example pinyin: Qǐng zhàn zài qǐshèxiàn hòumiàn.
Example (EN): Please stand behind the shooting line.
Notes: Also called 射击线 (shèjīxiàn) or 发射线 (fāshèxiàn).

id: seed-zh-archery-040
Simplified: 等候线
Traditional: 等候線
Pinyin: děnghòuxiàn
English: waiting line
Measure word: 条 (tiáo)
Example (Simplified): 不射箭的人留在等候线后。
Example (Traditional): 不射箭的人留在等候線後。
Example pinyin: Bù shèjiàn de rén liú zài děnghòuxiàn hòu.
Example (EN): People who aren't shooting stay behind the waiting line.
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-archery-039]]

id: seed-zh-archery-041
Simplified: 空放
Traditional: 空放
Pinyin: kōngfàng
English: to dry-fire (release without an arrow)
Example (Simplified): 千万不要空放，会弄坏弓。
Example (Traditional): 千萬不要空放，會弄壞弓。
Example pinyin: Qiānwàn bùyào kōngfàng, huì nònghuài gōng.
Example (EN): Never dry-fire: it can break the bow.

id: seed-zh-archery-042
Simplified: 停止
Traditional: 停止
Pinyin: tíngzhǐ
English: to stop
Example (Simplified): 听到哨声，马上停止射箭。
Example (Traditional): 聽到哨聲，馬上停止射箭。
Example pinyin: Tīngdào shàoshēng, mǎshàng tíngzhǐ shèjiàn.
Example (EN): When you hear the whistle, stop shooting immediately.

id: seed-zh-archery-043
Simplified: 裁判
Traditional: 裁判
Pinyin: cáipàn
English: judge, referee
Measure word: 名 (míng)
Example (Simplified): 裁判正在计分。
Example (Traditional): 裁判正在計分。
Example pinyin: Cáipàn zhèngzài jìfēn.
Example (EN): The judge is recording the scores.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-archery-033]]

id: seed-zh-archery-044
Simplified: 拉力
Traditional: 拉力
Pinyin: lālì
English: draw weight
Example (Simplified): 新手应该用拉力小的弓。
Example (Traditional): 新手應該用拉力小的弓。
Example pinyin: Xīnshǒu yīnggāi yòng lālì xiǎo de gōng.
Example (EN): Beginners should use a bow with a light draw weight.
Notes: Usually measured in 磅 (bàng, pounds).

id: seed-zh-archery-045
Simplified: 磅
Traditional: 磅
Pinyin: bàng
English: pound (unit of weight)
Example (Simplified): 我的弓是二十八磅的。
Example (Traditional): 我的弓是二十八磅的。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de gōng shì èrshíbā bàng de.
Example (EN): My bow is 28 pounds.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-archery-044]]

id: seed-zh-archery-046
Simplified: 准
Traditional: 準
Pinyin: zhǔn
English: accurate, precise
Example (Simplified): 他的箭越来越准了。
Example (Traditional): 他的箭越來越準了。
Example pinyin: Tā de jiàn yuè lái yuè zhǔn le.
Example (EN): His shooting is getting more and more accurate.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-019]]

id: seed-zh-archery-047
Simplified: 新手
Traditional: 新手
Pinyin: xīnshǒu
English: beginner, novice
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我是新手，请多指教。
Example (Traditional): 我是新手，請多指教。
Example pinyin: Wǒ shì xīnshǒu, qǐng duō zhǐjiào.
Example (EN): I'm a beginner, so please give me lots of advice.

id: seed-zh-archery-048
Simplified: 弓臂
Traditional: 弓臂
Pinyin: gōngbì
English: bow limb
Example (Simplified): 反曲弓的弓臂可以拆下来。
Example (Traditional): 反曲弓的弓臂可以拆下來。
Example pinyin: Fǎnqūgōng de gōngbì kěyǐ chāi xiàlai.
Example (EN): The limbs of a recurve bow can be taken off.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-002]]

id: seed-zh-archery-049
Simplified: 弓把
Traditional: 弓把
Pinyin: gōngbǎ
English: bow grip, handle (riser)
Example (Simplified): 握弓把的时候不要太紧。
Example (Traditional): 握弓把的時候不要太緊。
Example pinyin: Wò gōngbǎ de shíhou bùyào tài jǐn.
Example (EN): Don't grip the bow handle too tightly.
Notes: The riser is also called 弓身 (gōngshēn).

id: seed-zh-archery-050
Simplified: 稳定
Traditional: 穩定
Pinyin: wěndìng
English: stable, steady; consistency
Example (Simplified): 射箭最重要的是稳定。
Example (Traditional): 射箭最重要的是穩定。
Example pinyin: Shèjiàn zuì zhòngyào de shì wěndìng.
Example (EN): The most important thing in archery is consistency.


@deck 健身 Gym & weightlifting
@type Chinese Vocab
@tags gym
@languages zh-CN en-US

id: seed-zh-gym-001
Simplified: 健身
Traditional: 健身
Pinyin: jiànshēn
English: to work out; fitness
Example (Simplified): 我一周健身三次。
Example (Traditional): 我一週健身三次。
Example pinyin: Wǒ yī zhōu jiànshēn sān cì.
Example (EN): I work out three times a week.

id: seed-zh-gym-002
Simplified: 健身房
Traditional: 健身房
Pinyin: jiànshēnfáng
English: gym
Measure word: 家 (jiā)
Example (Simplified): 这家健身房二十四小时开门。
Example (Traditional): 這家健身房二十四小時開門。
Example pinyin: Zhè jiā jiànshēnfáng èrshísì xiǎoshí kāimén.
Example (EN): This gym is open 24 hours.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-001]]

id: seed-zh-gym-003
Simplified: 杠铃
Traditional: 槓鈴
Pinyin: gànglíng
English: barbell
Measure word: 根 (gēn)
Example (Simplified): 他把杠铃放回架子上。
Example (Traditional): 他把槓鈴放回架子上。
Example pinyin: Tā bǎ gànglíng fàng huí jiàzi shang.
Example (EN): He put the barbell back on the rack.
Notes: The bar by itself is 杠铃杆 (gànglínggǎn) or just 杠 (gàng).

id: seed-zh-gym-004
Simplified: 哑铃
Traditional: 啞鈴
Pinyin: yǎlíng
English: dumbbell
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我需要一对十公斤的哑铃。
Example (Traditional): 我需要一對十公斤的啞鈴。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xūyào yī duì shí gōngjīn de yǎlíng.
Example (EN): I need a pair of 10 kg dumbbells.
Notes: 一对 (yī duì) = a pair.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-003]]

id: seed-zh-gym-005
Simplified: 杠铃片
Traditional: 槓鈴片
Pinyin: gànglíngpiàn
English: weight plate
Measure word: 片 (piàn)
Example (Simplified): 两边各加一片二十公斤的杠铃片。
Example (Traditional): 兩邊各加一片二十公斤的槓鈴片。
Example pinyin: Liǎngbiān gè jiā yī piàn èrshí gōngjīn de gànglíngpiàn.
Example (EN): Add a 20 kg plate to each side.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-003]]

id: seed-zh-gym-006
Simplified: 卧推凳
Traditional: 臥推凳
Pinyin: wòtuīdèng
English: weight bench
Measure word: 张 (zhāng)
Example (Simplified): 卧推凳上没人，你用吧。
Example (Traditional): 臥推凳上沒人，你用吧。
Example pinyin: Wòtuīdèng shang méi rén, nǐ yòng ba.
Example (EN): Nobody's on the bench, go ahead and use it.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-013]]

id: seed-zh-gym-007
Simplified: 深蹲架
Traditional: 深蹲架
Pinyin: shēndūnjià
English: squat rack
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 深蹲架都有人在用。
Example (Traditional): 深蹲架都有人在用。
Example pinyin: Shēndūnjià dōu yǒu rén zài yòng.
Example (EN): All the squat racks are in use.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-011]]

id: seed-zh-gym-008
Simplified: 壶铃
Traditional: 壺鈴
Pinyin: húlíng
English: kettlebell
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 壶铃摆动练的是臀部。
Example (Traditional): 壺鈴擺動練的是臀部。
Example pinyin: Húlíng bǎidòng liàn de shì túnbù.
Example (EN): Kettlebell swings work the glutes.

id: seed-zh-gym-009
Simplified: 跑步机
Traditional: 跑步機
Pinyin: pǎobùjī
English: treadmill
Measure word: 台 (tái)
Example (Simplified): 我先在跑步机上跑十分钟。
Example (Traditional): 我先在跑步機上跑十分鐘。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xiān zài pǎobùjī shang pǎo shí fēnzhōng.
Example (EN): First I'll run on the treadmill for ten minutes.

id: seed-zh-gym-010
Simplified: 器械
Traditional: 器械
Pinyin: qìxiè
English: equipment, machines
Example (Simplified): 用完器械请放回原处。
Example (Traditional): 用完器械請放回原處。
Example pinyin: Yòngwán qìxiè qǐng fàng huí yuánchù.
Example (EN): Please put equipment back where it belongs after use.

id: seed-zh-gym-011
Simplified: 深蹲
Traditional: 深蹲
Pinyin: shēndūn
English: squat
Example (Simplified): 今天练腿，先做深蹲。
Example (Traditional): 今天練腿，先做深蹲。
Example pinyin: Jīntiān liàn tuǐ, xiān zuò shēndūn.
Example (EN): Today is leg day, so squats first.

id: seed-zh-gym-012
Simplified: 硬拉
Traditional: 硬拉
Pinyin: yìnglā
English: deadlift
Example (Simplified): 他硬拉能拉两百公斤。
Example (Traditional): 他硬拉能拉兩百公斤。
Example pinyin: Tā yìnglā néng lā liǎng bǎi gōngjīn.
Example (EN): He can deadlift 200 kg.

id: seed-zh-gym-013
Simplified: 卧推
Traditional: 臥推
Pinyin: wòtuī
English: bench press
Example (Simplified): 卧推的时候，脚要踩稳地面。
Example (Traditional): 臥推的時候，腳要踩穩地面。
Example pinyin: Wòtuī de shíhou, jiǎo yào cǎi wěn dìmiàn.
Example (EN): When you bench press, keep your feet planted on the floor.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-003]]

id: seed-zh-gym-014
Simplified: 推举
Traditional: 推舉
Pinyin: tuījǔ
English: overhead press, shoulder press
Example (Simplified): 推举可以练肩膀。
Example (Traditional): 推舉可以練肩膀。
Example pinyin: Tuījǔ kěyǐ liàn jiānbǎng.
Example (EN): The overhead press works your shoulders.
Notes: Also called 肩推 (jiāntuī).
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-033]]

id: seed-zh-gym-015
Simplified: 引体向上
Traditional: 引體向上
Pinyin: yǐntǐ xiàngshàng
English: pull-up, chin-up
Example (Simplified): 我现在能做五个引体向上。
Example (Traditional): 我現在能做五個引體向上。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xiànzài néng zuò wǔ gè yǐntǐ xiàngshàng.
Example (EN): I can now do five pull-ups.

id: seed-zh-gym-016
Simplified: 划船
Traditional: 划船
Pinyin: huáchuán
English: row (exercise); to row a boat
Example (Simplified): 杠铃划船练的是背。
Example (Traditional): 槓鈴划船練的是背。
Example pinyin: Gànglíng huáchuán liàn de shì bèi.
Example (EN): Barbell rows work the back.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-032]]

id: seed-zh-gym-017
Simplified: 弓步
Traditional: 弓步
Pinyin: gōngbù
English: lunge
Example (Simplified): 我们做三组弓步。
Example (Traditional): 我們做三組弓步。
Example pinyin: Wǒmen zuò sān zǔ gōngbù.
Example (EN): Let's do three sets of lunges.
Notes: Literally "bow step", from the martial-arts bow stance.
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-002]]

id: seed-zh-gym-018
Simplified: 卷腹
Traditional: 捲腹
Pinyin: juǎnfù
English: crunch
Example (Simplified): 卷腹比仰卧起坐对腰更友好。
Example (Traditional): 捲腹比仰臥起坐對腰更友好。
Example pinyin: Juǎnfù bǐ yǎngwò qǐzuò duì yāo gèng yǒuhǎo.
Example (EN): Crunches are easier on your lower back than sit-ups.

id: seed-zh-gym-019
Simplified: 仰卧起坐
Traditional: 仰臥起坐
Pinyin: yǎngwò qǐzuò
English: sit-up
Example (Simplified): 他每天早上做五十个仰卧起坐。
Example (Traditional): 他每天早上做五十個仰臥起坐。
Example pinyin: Tā měitiān zǎoshang zuò wǔshí gè yǎngwò qǐzuò.
Example (EN): He does 50 sit-ups every morning.

id: seed-zh-gym-020
Simplified: 俯卧撑
Traditional: 俯臥撐
Pinyin: fǔwòchēng
English: push-up
Example (Simplified): 我做了三十个俯卧撑。
Example (Traditional): 我做了三十個俯臥撐。
Example pinyin: Wǒ zuòle sānshí gè fǔwòchēng.
Example (EN): I did 30 push-ups.
Notes: Taiwan: 伏地挺身 (fúdì tǐngshēn).

id: seed-zh-gym-021
Simplified: 平板支撑
Traditional: 平板支撐
Pinyin: píngbǎn zhīchēng
English: plank
Example (Simplified): 平板支撑坚持一分钟。
Example (Traditional): 平板支撐堅持一分鐘。
Example pinyin: Píngbǎn zhīchēng jiānchí yī fēnzhōng.
Example (EN): Hold the plank for one minute.

id: seed-zh-gym-022
Simplified: 组
Traditional: 組
Pinyin: zǔ
English: set (of an exercise)
Example (Simplified): 每个动作做四组。
Example (Traditional): 每個動作做四組。
Example pinyin: Měi gè dòngzuò zuò sì zǔ.
Example (EN): Do four sets of each exercise.

id: seed-zh-gym-023
Simplified: 次
Traditional: 次
Pinyin: cì
English: rep; time, occurrence
Example (Simplified): 每组做十次。
Example (Traditional): 每組做十次。
Example pinyin: Měi zǔ zuò shí cì.
Example (EN): Do ten reps per set.
Notes: 个 (gè) is also used to count reps.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-022]]

id: seed-zh-gym-024
Simplified: 休息
Traditional: 休息
Pinyin: xiūxi
English: to rest; rest
Example (Simplified): 组间休息两分钟。
Example (Traditional): 組間休息兩分鐘。
Example pinyin: Zǔ jiān xiūxi liǎng fēnzhōng.
Example (EN): Rest for two minutes between sets.

id: seed-zh-gym-025
Simplified: 热身
Traditional: 熱身
Pinyin: rèshēn
English: to warm up; warm-up
Example (Simplified): 训练前一定要热身。
Example (Traditional): 訓練前一定要熱身。
Example pinyin: Xùnliàn qián yīdìng yào rèshēn.
Example (EN): Always warm up before training.

id: seed-zh-gym-026
Simplified: 拉伸
Traditional: 拉伸
Pinyin: lāshēn
English: to stretch; stretching
Example (Simplified): 练完以后记得拉伸。
Example (Traditional): 練完以後記得拉伸。
Example pinyin: Liànwán yǐhòu jìde lāshēn.
Example (EN): Remember to stretch after your workout.
Notes: Taiwan often says 伸展 (shēnzhǎn).

id: seed-zh-gym-027
Simplified: 训练
Traditional: 訓練
Pinyin: xùnliàn
English: to train; training
Example (Simplified): 他每天训练一个小时。
Example (Traditional): 他每天訓練一個小時。
Example pinyin: Tā měitiān xùnliàn yī gè xiǎoshí.
Example (EN): He trains for an hour every day.

id: seed-zh-gym-028
Simplified: 重量
Traditional: 重量
Pinyin: zhòngliàng
English: weight, load
Example (Simplified): 下一组加点重量。
Example (Traditional): 下一組加點重量。
Example pinyin: Xià yī zǔ jiā diǎn zhòngliàng.
Example (EN): Add a bit more weight for the next set.

id: seed-zh-gym-029
Simplified: 公斤
Traditional: 公斤
Pinyin: gōngjīn
English: kilogram
Example (Simplified): 我卧推六十公斤。
Example (Traditional): 我臥推六十公斤。
Example pinyin: Wǒ wòtuī liùshí gōngjīn.
Example (EN): I bench 60 kg.
Notes: 斤 (jīn) = half a kilogram, used when shopping for food.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-028]]

id: seed-zh-gym-030
Simplified: 肌肉
Traditional: 肌肉
Pinyin: jīròu
English: muscle
Measure word: 块 (kuài)
Example (Simplified): 他的肌肉很发达。
Example (Traditional): 他的肌肉很發達。
Example pinyin: Tā de jīròu hěn fādá.
Example (EN): He's very muscular.

id: seed-zh-gym-031
Simplified: 腿
Traditional: 腿
Pinyin: tuǐ
English: leg
Measure word: 条 (tiáo)
Example (Simplified): 昨天练腿，今天腿很酸。
Example (Traditional): 昨天練腿，今天腿很痠。
Example pinyin: Zuótiān liàn tuǐ, jīntiān tuǐ hěn suān.
Example (EN): I trained legs yesterday, and today they're sore.
Notes: 练腿 (liàn tuǐ) = leg day.
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-cats-005]]

id: seed-zh-gym-032
Simplified: 背
Traditional: 背
Pinyin: bèi
English: back (of the body)
Example (Simplified): 硬拉的时候背要挺直。
Example (Traditional): 硬拉的時候背要挺直。
Example pinyin: Yìnglā de shíhou bèi yào tǐngzhí.
Example (EN): Keep your back straight when you deadlift.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-012]]

id: seed-zh-gym-033
Simplified: 肩膀
Traditional: 肩膀
Pinyin: jiānbǎng
English: shoulder
Example (Simplified): 我的肩膀有点疼。
Example (Traditional): 我的肩膀有點疼。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de jiānbǎng yǒudiǎn téng.
Example (EN): My shoulder hurts a bit.

id: seed-zh-gym-034
Simplified: 胸
Traditional: 胸
Pinyin: xiōng
English: chest
Example (Simplified): 卧推主要练胸。
Example (Traditional): 臥推主要練胸。
Example pinyin: Wòtuī zhǔyào liàn xiōng.
Example (EN): The bench press mainly works the chest.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-013]]

id: seed-zh-gym-035
Simplified: 手臂
Traditional: 手臂
Pinyin: shǒubì
English: arm
Example (Simplified): 他的手臂很粗。
Example (Traditional): 他的手臂很粗。
Example pinyin: Tā de shǒubì hěn cū.
Example (EN): His arms are really big.
Notes: 胳膊 (gēbo) is the everyday word.

id: seed-zh-gym-036
Simplified: 腹肌
Traditional: 腹肌
Pinyin: fùjī
English: abs, abdominal muscles
Example (Simplified): 练腹肌也要控制饮食。
Example (Traditional): 練腹肌也要控制飲食。
Example pinyin: Liàn fùjī yě yào kòngzhì yǐnshí.
Example (EN): To get abs, you also need to watch your diet.

id: seed-zh-gym-037
Simplified: 臀部
Traditional: 臀部
Pinyin: túnbù
English: glutes, buttocks
Example (Simplified): 深蹲能练臀部和大腿。
Example (Traditional): 深蹲能練臀部和大腿。
Example pinyin: Shēndūn néng liàn túnbù hé dàtuǐ.
Example (EN): Squats work your glutes and thighs.

id: seed-zh-gym-038
Simplified: 膝盖
Traditional: 膝蓋
Pinyin: xīgài
English: knee
Example (Simplified): 深蹲时膝盖朝着脚尖的方向。
Example (Traditional): 深蹲時膝蓋朝著腳尖的方向。
Example pinyin: Shēndūn shí xīgài cháozhe jiǎojiān de fāngxiàng.
Example (EN): When squatting, keep your knees pointing the same way as your toes.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-011]]

id: seed-zh-gym-039
Simplified: 核心
Traditional: 核心
Pinyin: héxīn
English: core (muscles)
Example (Simplified): 收紧核心，不要塌腰。
Example (Traditional): 收緊核心，不要塌腰。
Example pinyin: Shōujǐn héxīn, bùyào tā yāo.
Example (EN): Brace your core and don't let your lower back sag.

id: seed-zh-gym-040
Simplified: 挺胸
Traditional: 挺胸
Pinyin: tǐngxiōng
English: chest up (form cue)
Example (Simplified): 挺胸，肩膀向后收。
Example (Traditional): 挺胸，肩膀向後收。
Example pinyin: Tǐngxiōng, jiānbǎng xiàng hòu shōu.
Example (EN): Chest up, pull your shoulders back.
links: same root [[seed-zh-gym-034]]

id: seed-zh-gym-041
Simplified: 动作
Traditional: 動作
Pinyin: dòngzuò
English: movement; form, technique
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 动作要标准，别贪重量。
Example (Traditional): 動作要標準，別貪重量。
Example pinyin: Dòngzuò yào biāozhǔn, bié tān zhòngliàng.
Example (EN): Keep your form strict; don't chase heavy weights.

id: seed-zh-gym-042
Simplified: 慢慢来
Traditional: 慢慢來
Pinyin: mànmàn lái
English: take your time, take it slow
Example (Simplified): 别着急，慢慢来。
Example (Traditional): 別著急，慢慢來。
Example pinyin: Bié zháojí, mànmàn lái.
Example (EN): Don't rush, take it slow.

id: seed-zh-gym-043
Simplified: 保护
Traditional: 保護
Pinyin: bǎohù
English: to spot (someone); to protect
Example (Simplified): 你能帮我保护一下吗？
Example (Traditional): 你能幫我保護一下嗎？
Example pinyin: Nǐ néng bāng wǒ bǎohù yīxià ma?
Example (EN): Could you spot me?
Notes: In the gym 保护 means "to spot".

id: seed-zh-gym-044
Simplified: 力量
Traditional: 力量
Pinyin: lìliang
English: strength, power
Example (Simplified): 我想提高力量。
Example (Traditional): 我想提高力量。
Example pinyin: Wǒ xiǎng tígāo lìliang.
Example (EN): I want to get stronger.
Notes: 力量训练 (lìliang xùnliàn) = strength training.

id: seed-zh-gym-045
Simplified: 有氧
Traditional: 有氧
Pinyin: yǒuyǎng
English: cardio, aerobic exercise
Example (Simplified): 练完力量再做二十分钟有氧。
Example (Traditional): 練完力量再做二十分鐘有氧。
Example pinyin: Liànwán lìliang zài zuò èrshí fēnzhōng yǒuyǎng.
Example (EN): After strength training, do 20 minutes of cardio.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-gym-044]]

id: seed-zh-gym-046
Simplified: 蛋白粉
Traditional: 蛋白粉
Pinyin: dànbáifěn
English: protein powder
Example (Simplified): 训练后我喝一杯蛋白粉。
Example (Traditional): 訓練後我喝一杯蛋白粉。
Example pinyin: Xùnliàn hòu wǒ hē yī bēi dànbáifěn.
Example (EN): I have a protein shake after training.

id: seed-zh-gym-047
Simplified: 增肌
Traditional: 增肌
Pinyin: zēngjī
English: to build muscle, to bulk
Example (Simplified): 增肌要多吃蛋白质。
Example (Traditional): 增肌要多吃蛋白質。
Example pinyin: Zēngjī yào duō chī dànbáizhì.
Example (EN): To build muscle, eat plenty of protein.

id: seed-zh-gym-048
Simplified: 减脂
Traditional: 減脂
Pinyin: jiǎnzhī
English: to cut, to lose fat
Example (Simplified): 我这个月在减脂。
Example (Traditional): 我這個月在減脂。
Example pinyin: Wǒ zhège yuè zài jiǎnzhī.
Example (EN): I'm cutting this month.
links: antonym [[seed-zh-gym-047]]

id: seed-zh-gym-049
Simplified: 酸痛
Traditional: 痠痛
Pinyin: suāntòng
English: sore, aching (muscles)
Example (Simplified): 第一次练完，全身酸痛。
Example (Traditional): 第一次練完，全身痠痛。
Example pinyin: Dì yī cì liànwán, quánshēn suāntòng.
Example (EN): After my first workout, my whole body ached.
Notes: Traditional often writes 痠 for muscle soreness.

id: seed-zh-gym-050
Simplified: 握
Traditional: 握
Pinyin: wò
English: to grip, to hold
Example (Simplified): 双手握杠比肩宽一点。
Example (Traditional): 雙手握槓比肩寬一點。
Example pinyin: Shuāngshǒu wò gàng bǐ jiān kuān yīdiǎn.
Example (EN): Grip the bar a little wider than shoulder width.

id: seed-zh-gym-051
Simplified: 私教
Traditional: 私教
Pinyin: sījiào
English: personal trainer
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我请了一个私教。
Example (Traditional): 我請了一個私教。
Example pinyin: Wǒ qǐngle yī gè sījiào.
Example (EN): I've hired a personal trainer.
Notes: Short for 私人教练 (sīrén jiàoliàn).
links: same root [[seed-zh-archery-037]]


@deck 猫 Cats
@type Chinese Vocab
@tags cats
@languages zh-CN en-US

id: seed-zh-cats-001
Simplified: 猫
Traditional: 貓
Pinyin: māo
English: cat
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 我家有两只猫。
Example (Traditional): 我家有兩隻貓。
Example pinyin: Wǒ jiā yǒu liǎng zhī māo.
Example (EN): I have two cats at home.
Notes: 只 (Traditional 隻) is the measure word for cats and most animals.

id: seed-zh-cats-002
Simplified: 小猫
Traditional: 小貓
Pinyin: xiǎomāo
English: kitten
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 这只小猫才两个月大。
Example (Traditional): 這隻小貓才兩個月大。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī xiǎomāo cái liǎng gè yuè dà.
Example (EN): This kitten is only two months old.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-003
Simplified: 猫咪
Traditional: 貓咪
Pinyin: māomī
English: kitty, cat (affectionate)
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 猫咪在沙发上睡觉。
Example (Traditional): 貓咪在沙發上睡覺。
Example pinyin: Māomī zài shāfā shang shuìjiào.
Example (EN): The kitty is sleeping on the sofa.
links: synonym [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-004
Simplified: 胡须
Traditional: 鬍鬚
Pinyin: húxū
English: whiskers
Measure word: 根 (gēn)
Example (Simplified): 猫的胡须非常敏感。
Example (Traditional): 貓的鬍鬚非常敏感。
Example pinyin: Māo de húxū fēicháng mǐngǎn.
Example (EN): A cat's whiskers are very sensitive.
Notes: Colloquially 胡子 (húzi).

id: seed-zh-cats-005
Simplified: 尾巴
Traditional: 尾巴
Pinyin: wěiba
English: tail
Measure word: 条 (tiáo)
Example (Simplified): 猫生气时会甩尾巴。
Example (Traditional): 貓生氣時會甩尾巴。
Example pinyin: Māo shēngqì shí huì shuǎi wěiba.
Example (EN): Cats swish their tails when they're annoyed.

id: seed-zh-cats-006
Simplified: 爪子
Traditional: 爪子
Pinyin: zhuǎzi
English: paw; claw
Example (Simplified): 小猫用爪子玩毛线。
Example (Traditional): 小貓用爪子玩毛線。
Example pinyin: Xiǎomāo yòng zhuǎzi wán máoxiàn.
Example (EN): The kitten plays with yarn using its paws.
Notes: 爪 is read zhuǎ here; zhǎo in more literary words.

id: seed-zh-cats-007
Simplified: 肉垫
Traditional: 肉墊
Pinyin: ròudiàn
English: paw pad
Example (Simplified): 我家猫的肉垫是粉色的。
Example (Traditional): 我家貓的肉墊是粉色的。
Example pinyin: Wǒ jiā māo de ròudiàn shì fěnsè de.
Example (EN): My cat's paw pads are pink.
Notes: Also called 肉球 (ròuqiú).

id: seed-zh-cats-008
Simplified: 耳朵
Traditional: 耳朵
Pinyin: ěrduo
English: ear
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 猫的耳朵竖起来了。
Example (Traditional): 貓的耳朵豎起來了。
Example pinyin: Māo de ěrduo shù qǐlai le.
Example (EN): The cat's ears pricked up.
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-009
Simplified: 眼睛
Traditional: 眼睛
Pinyin: yǎnjing
English: eye
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 这只猫的眼睛是蓝色的。
Example (Traditional): 這隻貓的眼睛是藍色的。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī māo de yǎnjing shì lánsè de.
Example (EN): This cat has blue eyes.
Notes: A pair of eyes: 一双眼睛 (yī shuāng yǎnjing).

id: seed-zh-cats-010
Simplified: 毛
Traditional: 毛
Pinyin: máo
English: fur, hair (of animals)
Example (Simplified): 我的衣服上都是猫毛。
Example (Traditional): 我的衣服上都是貓毛。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de yīfu shang dōu shì māomáo.
Example (EN): My clothes are covered in cat hair.

id: seed-zh-cats-011
Simplified: 舌头
Traditional: 舌頭
Pinyin: shétou
English: tongue
Example (Simplified): 猫的舌头很粗糙。
Example (Traditional): 貓的舌頭很粗糙。
Example pinyin: Māo de shétou hěn cūcāo.
Example (EN): A cat's tongue is very rough.

id: seed-zh-cats-012
Simplified: 喵
Traditional: 喵
Pinyin: miāo
English: meow
Example (Simplified): 小猫喵喵叫。
Example (Traditional): 小貓喵喵叫。
Example pinyin: Xiǎomāo miāomiāo jiào.
Example (EN): The kitten is meowing.

id: seed-zh-cats-013
Simplified: 叫
Traditional: 叫
Pinyin: jiào
English: to meow, to cry (of animals); to call
Example (Simplified): 猫饿了就会一直叫。
Example (Traditional): 貓餓了就會一直叫。
Example pinyin: Māo è le jiù huì yīzhí jiào.
Example (EN): When the cat is hungry, it meows nonstop.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-cats-012]]

id: seed-zh-cats-014
Simplified: 打呼噜
Traditional: 打呼嚕
Pinyin: dǎ hūlu
English: to purr; to snore
Example (Simplified): 猫舒服的时候会打呼噜。
Example (Traditional): 貓舒服的時候會打呼嚕。
Example pinyin: Māo shūfu de shíhou huì dǎ hūlu.
Example (EN): Cats purr when they're comfortable.

id: seed-zh-cats-015
Simplified: 抓
Traditional: 抓
Pinyin: zhuā
English: to scratch; to catch
Example (Simplified): 别让猫抓沙发。
Example (Traditional): 別讓貓抓沙發。
Example pinyin: Bié ràng māo zhuā shāfā.
Example (EN): Don't let the cat scratch the sofa.

id: seed-zh-cats-016
Simplified: 舔毛
Traditional: 舔毛
Pinyin: tiǎnmáo
English: to groom (by licking fur)
Example (Simplified): 猫每天花很多时间舔毛。
Example (Traditional): 貓每天花很多時間舔毛。
Example pinyin: Māo měitiān huā hěn duō shíjiān tiǎnmáo.
Example (EN): Cats spend a lot of time grooming every day.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-010]]

id: seed-zh-cats-017
Simplified: 咬
Traditional: 咬
Pinyin: yǎo
English: to bite
Example (Simplified): 小猫咬了我的手指。
Example (Traditional): 小貓咬了我的手指。
Example pinyin: Xiǎomāo yǎole wǒ de shǒuzhǐ.
Example (EN): The kitten bit my finger.

id: seed-zh-cats-018
Simplified: 睡觉
Traditional: 睡覺
Pinyin: shuìjiào
English: to sleep
Example (Simplified): 我的猫喜欢在窗边睡觉。
Example (Traditional): 我的貓喜歡在窗邊睡覺。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de māo xǐhuan zài chuāng biān shuìjiào.
Example (EN): My cat likes to sleep by the window.

id: seed-zh-cats-019
Simplified: 蹭
Traditional: 蹭
Pinyin: cèng
English: to rub against
Example (Simplified): 猫用头蹭我的腿。
Example (Traditional): 貓用頭蹭我的腿。
Example pinyin: Māo yòng tóu cèng wǒ de tuǐ.
Example (EN): The cat rubs its head against my leg.

id: seed-zh-cats-020
Simplified: 踩奶
Traditional: 踩奶
Pinyin: cǎinǎi
English: to knead ("make biscuits")
Example (Simplified): 猫在毯子上踩奶。
Example (Traditional): 貓在毯子上踩奶。
Example pinyin: Māo zài tǎnzi shang cǎinǎi.
Example (EN): The cat is kneading the blanket.
Notes: Literally "treading milk", from how kittens knead while nursing.

id: seed-zh-cats-021
Simplified: 撒娇
Traditional: 撒嬌
Pinyin: sājiāo
English: to act cute, to ask for attention
Example (Simplified): 我的猫很会撒娇。
Example (Traditional): 我的貓很會撒嬌。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de māo hěn huì sājiāo.
Example (EN): My cat really knows how to act cute for attention.

id: seed-zh-cats-022
Simplified: 老鼠
Traditional: 老鼠
Pinyin: lǎoshǔ
English: mouse, rat
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 猫抓到了一只老鼠。
Example (Traditional): 貓抓到了一隻老鼠。
Example pinyin: Māo zhuādàole yī zhī lǎoshǔ.
Example (EN): The cat caught a mouse.
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-023
Simplified: 猫砂
Traditional: 貓砂
Pinyin: māoshā
English: cat litter
Example (Simplified): 这种猫砂结团很快。
Example (Traditional): 這種貓砂結團很快。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhǒng māoshā jiétuán hěn kuài.
Example (EN): This kind of litter clumps quickly.

id: seed-zh-cats-024
Simplified: 猫砂盆
Traditional: 貓砂盆
Pinyin: māoshāpén
English: litter box
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 猫砂盆要每天清理。
Example (Traditional): 貓砂盆要每天清理。
Example pinyin: Māoshāpén yào měitiān qīnglǐ.
Example (EN): The litter box should be cleaned every day.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-023]]

id: seed-zh-cats-025
Simplified: 猫粮
Traditional: 貓糧
Pinyin: māoliáng
English: cat food (dry)
Example (Simplified): 猫粮快吃完了，得去买。
Example (Traditional): 貓糧快吃完了，得去買。
Example pinyin: Māoliáng kuài chīwán le, děi qù mǎi.
Example (EN): The cat food is almost gone, so we need to buy more.

id: seed-zh-cats-026
Simplified: 罐头
Traditional: 罐頭
Pinyin: guàntou
English: canned food, tin
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 周末给猫开一个罐头。
Example (Traditional): 週末給貓開一個罐頭。
Example pinyin: Zhōumò gěi māo kāi yī gè guàntou.
Example (EN): At weekends I open a can of food for the cat.
Notes: 猫罐头 (māo guàntou) = canned cat food.

id: seed-zh-cats-027
Simplified: 猫抓板
Traditional: 貓抓板
Pinyin: māozhuābǎn
English: cat scratcher, scratching board
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我们买了一个新的猫抓板。
Example (Traditional): 我們買了一個新的貓抓板。
Example pinyin: Wǒmen mǎile yī gè xīn de māozhuābǎn.
Example (EN): We bought a new cat scratcher.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-015]]

id: seed-zh-cats-028
Simplified: 猫爬架
Traditional: 貓爬架
Pinyin: māopájià
English: cat tree
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 猫最喜欢待在猫爬架的最高层。
Example (Traditional): 貓最喜歡待在貓爬架的最高層。
Example pinyin: Māo zuì xǐhuan dāi zài māopájià de zuì gāo céng.
Example (EN): Cats love to sit on the top level of the cat tree.

id: seed-zh-cats-029
Simplified: 逗猫棒
Traditional: 逗貓棒
Pinyin: dòumāobàng
English: cat wand toy
Measure word: 根 (gēn)
Example (Simplified): 用逗猫棒陪猫玩一会儿。
Example (Traditional): 用逗貓棒陪貓玩一會兒。
Example pinyin: Yòng dòumāobàng péi māo wán yīhuìr.
Example (EN): Play with the cat for a while using the wand toy.
links: same measure word [[seed-zh-cats-004]]

id: seed-zh-cats-030
Simplified: 兽医
Traditional: 獸醫
Pinyin: shòuyī
English: vet, veterinarian
Measure word: 位 (wèi)
Example (Simplified): 明天我要带猫去看兽医。
Example (Traditional): 明天我要帶貓去看獸醫。
Example pinyin: Míngtiān wǒ yào dài māo qù kàn shòuyī.
Example (EN): Tomorrow I'm taking the cat to the vet.

id: seed-zh-cats-031
Simplified: 宠物医院
Traditional: 寵物醫院
Pinyin: chǒngwù yīyuàn
English: vet clinic, animal hospital
Measure word: 家 (jiā)
Example (Simplified): 附近有一家宠物医院。
Example (Traditional): 附近有一家寵物醫院。
Example pinyin: Fùjìn yǒu yī jiā chǒngwù yīyuàn.
Example (EN): There's a vet clinic nearby.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-035]] [[seed-zh-travel-037]]; collocation [[seed-zh-cats-030]]

id: seed-zh-cats-032
Simplified: 疫苗
Traditional: 疫苗
Pinyin: yìmiáo
English: vaccine
Measure word: 针 (zhēn)
Example (Simplified): 小猫要打三针疫苗。
Example (Traditional): 小貓要打三針疫苗。
Example pinyin: Xiǎomāo yào dǎ sān zhēn yìmiáo.
Example (EN): Kittens need three vaccine shots.
Notes: 打疫苗 (dǎ yìmiáo) = to get vaccinated.

id: seed-zh-cats-033
Simplified: 绝育
Traditional: 絕育
Pinyin: juéyù
English: to spay, to neuter
Example (Simplified): 我们的猫已经绝育了。
Example (Traditional): 我們的貓已經絕育了。
Example pinyin: Wǒmen de māo yǐjīng juéyù le.
Example (EN): Our cat has already been spayed.

id: seed-zh-cats-034
Simplified: 驱虫
Traditional: 驅蟲
Pinyin: qūchóng
English: to deworm, to treat for parasites
Example (Simplified): 记得定期给猫驱虫。
Example (Traditional): 記得定期給貓驅蟲。
Example pinyin: Jìde dìngqī gěi māo qūchóng.
Example (EN): Remember to treat the cat for parasites regularly.

id: seed-zh-cats-035
Simplified: 宠物
Traditional: 寵物
Pinyin: chǒngwù
English: pet
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 你养宠物吗？
Example (Traditional): 你養寵物嗎？
Example pinyin: Nǐ yǎng chǒngwù ma?
Example (EN): Do you have any pets?

id: seed-zh-cats-036
Simplified: 养
Traditional: 養
Pinyin: yǎng
English: to keep (a pet), to raise
Example (Simplified): 我从小就想养猫。
Example (Traditional): 我從小就想養貓。
Example pinyin: Wǒ cóngxiǎo jiù xiǎng yǎng māo.
Example (EN): I've wanted a cat ever since I was little.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-cats-035]]

id: seed-zh-cats-037
Simplified: 喂
Traditional: 餵
Pinyin: wèi
English: to feed
Example (Simplified): 我每天早晚各喂一次猫。
Example (Traditional): 我每天早晚各餵一次貓。
Example pinyin: Wǒ měitiān zǎo wǎn gè wèi yī cì māo.
Example (EN): I feed the cat once in the morning and once in the evening.
Notes: Traditional uses 餵 for "to feed"; 喂 is "hello" on the phone.
links: collocation [[seed-zh-cats-025]]

id: seed-zh-cats-038
Simplified: 梳毛
Traditional: 梳毛
Pinyin: shūmáo
English: to brush (fur)
Example (Simplified): 长毛猫需要每天梳毛。
Example (Traditional): 長毛貓需要每天梳毛。
Example pinyin: Chángmáo māo xūyào měitiān shūmáo.
Example (EN): Long-haired cats need brushing every day.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-010]]

id: seed-zh-cats-039
Simplified: 剪指甲
Traditional: 剪指甲
Pinyin: jiǎn zhǐjia
English: to trim nails/claws
Example (Simplified): 给猫剪指甲要小心。
Example (Traditional): 給貓剪指甲要小心。
Example pinyin: Gěi māo jiǎn zhǐjia yào xiǎoxīn.
Example (EN): Be careful when trimming the cat's claws.

id: seed-zh-cats-040
Simplified: 可爱
Traditional: 可愛
Pinyin: kě'ài
English: cute, lovely
Example (Simplified): 这只小猫太可爱了！
Example (Traditional): 這隻小貓太可愛了！
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī xiǎomāo tài kě'ài le!
Example (EN): This kitten is so cute!

id: seed-zh-cats-041
Simplified: 胖
Traditional: 胖
Pinyin: pàng
English: fat, chubby
Example (Simplified): 我的猫有点胖，要减肥了。
Example (Traditional): 我的貓有點胖，要減肥了。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de māo yǒudiǎn pàng, yào jiǎnféi le.
Example (EN): My cat is a bit chubby and needs to lose weight.
links: antonym [[seed-zh-cats-042]]

id: seed-zh-cats-042
Simplified: 瘦
Traditional: 瘦
Pinyin: shòu
English: thin, skinny
Example (Simplified): 这只流浪猫很瘦。
Example (Traditional): 這隻流浪貓很瘦。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī liúlàngmāo hěn shòu.
Example (EN): This stray cat is very thin.

id: seed-zh-cats-043
Simplified: 流浪猫
Traditional: 流浪貓
Pinyin: liúlàngmāo
English: stray cat
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 她收养了一只流浪猫。
Example (Traditional): 她收養了一隻流浪貓。
Example pinyin: Tā shōuyǎngle yī zhī liúlàngmāo.
Example (EN): She adopted a stray cat.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-044
Simplified: 橘猫
Traditional: 橘貓
Pinyin: júmāo
English: orange (ginger) cat
Measure word: 只 (zhī)
Example (Simplified): 都说橘猫特别能吃。
Example (Traditional): 都說橘貓特別能吃。
Example pinyin: Dōu shuō júmāo tèbié néng chī.
Example (EN): They say orange cats eat a lot.
Notes: A running joke online is that orange cats are always chubby.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-001]]

id: seed-zh-cats-045
Simplified: 软
Traditional: 軟
Pinyin: ruǎn
English: soft
Example (Simplified): 小猫的毛很软。
Example (Traditional): 小貓的毛很軟。
Example pinyin: Xiǎomāo de máo hěn ruǎn.
Example (EN): The kitten's fur is very soft.

id: seed-zh-cats-046
Simplified: 调皮
Traditional: 調皮
Pinyin: tiáopí
English: naughty, mischievous
Example (Simplified): 这只小猫特别调皮。
Example (Traditional): 這隻小貓特別調皮。
Example pinyin: Zhè zhī xiǎomāo tèbié tiáopí.
Example (EN): This kitten is really mischievous.
Notes: Also 顽皮 (wánpí).

id: seed-zh-cats-047
Simplified: 乖
Traditional: 乖
Pinyin: guāi
English: well-behaved, good
Example (Simplified): 我的猫很乖，从来不咬人。
Example (Traditional): 我的貓很乖，從來不咬人。
Example pinyin: Wǒ de māo hěn guāi, cónglái bù yǎo rén.
Example (EN): My cat is very well-behaved and never bites.
Notes: 真乖！(Zhēn guāi!) = Good boy/girl!
links: antonym [[seed-zh-cats-046]]

id: seed-zh-cats-048
Simplified: 怕
Traditional: 怕
Pinyin: pà
English: to be afraid of
Example (Simplified): 很多猫怕水。
Example (Traditional): 很多貓怕水。
Example pinyin: Hěn duō māo pà shuǐ.
Example (EN): Many cats are afraid of water.

id: seed-zh-cats-049
Simplified: 好奇
Traditional: 好奇
Pinyin: hàoqí
English: curious
Example (Simplified): 猫对什么都很好奇。
Example (Traditional): 貓對什麼都很好奇。
Example pinyin: Māo duì shénme dōu hěn hàoqí.
Example (EN): Cats are curious about everything.

id: seed-zh-cats-050
Simplified: 铲屎官
Traditional: 鏟屎官
Pinyin: chǎnshǐguān
English: cat owner (slang, lit. "poop-scooping officer")
Measure word: 个 (gè)
Example (Simplified): 我是两只猫的铲屎官。
Example (Traditional): 我是兩隻貓的鏟屎官。
Example pinyin: Wǒ shì liǎng zhī māo de chǎnshǐguān.
Example (EN): I'm the official poop-scooper for two cats.
Notes: Humorous internet slang for a pet owner.

id: seed-zh-cats-051
Simplified: 毛球
Traditional: 毛球
Pinyin: máoqiú
English: hairball
Example (Simplified): 猫有时候会吐毛球。
Example (Traditional): 貓有時候會吐毛球。
Example pinyin: Māo yǒu shíhou huì tù máoqiú.
Example (EN): Cats sometimes throw up hairballs.
links: same root [[seed-zh-cats-010]]
